      "html": "<aside class=\"blog-related bg-charcoal pointer-events-auto\" aria-labelledby=\"blog-related-heading\"><section class=\"blog-index-shell\" data-v-1c6297c3><p class=\"blog-eyebrow\">Keep reading</p><h2 id=\"blog-related-heading\" class=\"blog-section-heading\">More useful growth ideas.</h2><div class=\"blog-index-grid\"><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/best-ai-consulting-firms-london-uk-2026\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--ai\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">AI search visibility</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"75\" y=\"55\" width=\"350\" height=\"180\" rx=\"35\"/><path d=\"M130 110H350M130 150H310M130 190H265M340 235L390 280V235\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Answer clearly.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">What to include in a search and AI visibility brief</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Brief AI visibility work with a defined audience, useful customer questions, accurate business information and realistic observation methods.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 2 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/building-ai-that-delivers-business-value-q-and-a-with-our-founder\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--ai\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">AI search visibility</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"75\" y=\"55\" width=\"350\" height=\"180\" rx=\"35\"/><path d=\"M130 110H350M130 150H310M130 190H265M340 235L390 280V235\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Answer clearly.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">Questions to answer before investing in AI search visibility</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Ask what customers need, where your information is weak and how observations of AI answers will connect with useful business measures.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 2 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/10-questions-to-ask-before-hiring-a-digital-product-agency\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--strategy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Growth strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M50 210H170V100H310V155H510\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"210\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Connect the dots.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">10 questions to ask a growth agency</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Ten questions that reveal how an agency connects search, paid media and content with the customers your business needs.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a></div></section></aside>"
